{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on request 57c26eb9. The implementation child for head (b)\nis request a30f1b67, under parent 05d618e2.\n\nBoth cases report mismatch with the reason position. The report\nkeeps its seven members, and the table gains no reason.\n\nCase 1. The served bytes hash to the cited digest, and they do not\ndecode as an entry of the format.\n- Report: result mismatch, reason position, reached 0, anchor\n  null, trusts empty.\n- Why: level 0 passes, so these are the cited bytes. Level 1 reads\n  the fields. Bytes that carry no position cannot be the event at\n  the cited position. The bytes prove the citation wrong.\n- The same rule covers a predecessor during the walk of level 2.\n  The report then has reached 1.\n\nCase 2. An entry at position p above 0 passes levels 0 and 1, and\nits prev is null, absent or not a digest.\n- Report: result mismatch, reason position, reached 1, anchor\n  null, trusts empty.\n- Why: the walk ends before position 0. The table already gives\n  position for a walk that reaches a genesis before position 0.\n  The git formats report a commit without a parent above position\n  0 the same way.\n\nGeneral rule for level 1: a member that is absent or malformed\ndiffers from the cited value. So an entry above position 0 with no\ngenesis member reports sequence, and an entry with no integer seq\nreports position. For an entry that decodes, level 1 checks the\nsequence member first and the position second, as section 4 orders\nthem. Bytes that do not decode at all report position.\n\nNote edits in head (b), section 4 reason table only:\n- sequence: \"An event carries a different genesis digest, or none\n  where the format requires one.\"\n- position: add \"or the bytes carry no position, or an event above\n  position 0 carries no predecessor digest\".\nAdd both cases to vectors/dap1/cases.json and to the list of\nsection 7.\n\nEarly start: the typed source lane is idle, so head (b) source\nwork opens now. The executable slot order stays F, then G and H.\n\nDeployment notice: head E 8289d9e5 runs on all four Workers since\n12:12 EST. The END act is 634c0330.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}